<div class="component-demo">
  <h3>🖼️ Galerie (Masonry Grid)</h3>
  <p class="text-muted mb-4">
    Une grille de galerie fluide de style "Masonry", construite uniquement en CSS grâce à la propriété <code>column-count</code>. 
    Les images sont disposées verticalement sans espace vide horizontal.
  </p>

  <div class="row g-4 mb-5">
    <div class="col-12">
      <div class="box box-secondary mb-0">
        
        <div class="gallery">
          <div class="gallery-item">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1513360371669-4adf3dd7dff8?w=500&q=80" alt="Gallery">
          </div>
          <div class="gallery-item">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522071820081-009f0129c71c?w=500&q=80" alt="Gallery">
          </div>
          <div class="gallery-item">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507525428034-b723cf961d3e?w=500&q=80" alt="Gallery">
          </div>
          <div class="gallery-item">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1498050108023-c5249f4df085?w=500&q=80" alt="Gallery">
          </div>
          <div class="gallery-item">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1461749280684-dccba630e2f6?w=500&q=80" alt="Gallery">
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-4">
    <h5>Code d'exemple</h5>
    {% set codeExample %}
<div class="gallery">
  <div class="gallery-item">
    <img src="image1.jpg" alt="Description">
  </div>
  <div class="gallery-item">
    <img src="image2.jpg" alt="Description">
  </div>
  <div class="gallery-item">
    <img src="image3.jpg" alt="Description">
  </div>
</div>
    {% endset %}
    {% include 'fragments/components/_code-block.html.twig' with {
      'code': codeExample,
      'language': 'html',
      'title': 'Structure HTML Gallery'
    } %}
  </div>
</div>